  description: Hags are twisted, medium-sized fae crones, bent but still roughly
    human height. They move with a crooked, crippled walking gait, sometimes limping,
    but capable of surprising bursts of speed when provoked. Their voices are rasping,
    spiteful speech, full of curses, bargains, and mocking laughter.
